    { "id": "system-note", "page": "client", "x": 3080, "y": 960, "w": 340, "text": "Client system (Groww-inspired, original palette)\n\nGround #FFFFFF, cards white with #EAECF0 hairline, 16px radius. Action + gain green #0FA36B, loss #E04A3C, open-call indigo #4A55C7. Plus Jakarta Sans for text, JetBrains Mono for every number (tabular). 44px targets.\n\nTop tabs + search on desktop, bottom tabs on phone. No engine names anywhere.\n\nCalls, book and prices are SAMPLE values shaped like the real API." },
